#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store-delete.md:34
msgid "Description"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store-delete.md:36
msgid ""
"This command deletes the store paths specified by [_installables_](./nix."
"md#installables), but only if it is safe to do so; that is, when the path is "
"not reachable from a root of the garbage collector. This means that you can "
"only delete paths that would also be deleted by `nix store gc`. Thus, `nix "
"store delete` is a more targeted version of `nix store gc`."
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store-delete.md:43
msgid ""
"With the option `--ignore-liveness`, reachability from the roots is ignored. "
"However, the path still won't be deleted if there are other paths in the "
"store that refer to it (i.e., depend on it)."
msgstr ""

